# Trial client config (scaffold)

Populate Day 2: `client.yaml` + terraform env for BTP trial.

```yaml
client:
  id: trial
  display_name: FactoryPilot BTP Trial
environment: trial
runtime: cloudfoundry
adapters:
  llm_provider: openrouter
  db_engine: postgres
  cache_engine: redis
s4:
  destination_name: SAP_ACCELERATOR_HUB_SANDBOX
  auth_mode: hub_api_key
features:
  seed_delivery_bo: true
```
